## Non-Goals

This contract is not meant to:
- manage PNJC token economics,
- act as a treasury,
- support governance,
- support NFT liquidity locks,
- provide yield,
- provide fee collection logic.

## Summary

PNJC Liquidity Locker V2 is a minimal and immutable ERC-20 LP token locker built for transparent time-locked custody and public verifiability.
